# NOT ignored: /public/build
# The production host (shared cPanel) has no Node, so `npm run build` cannot
# run there and the compiled assets have to arrive with the code. They are
# small — a few hundred KB — and DesignSystemCssTest fails if what is
# committed no longer matches the sources. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
/public/hot
/public/storage
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
/vendor
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
Thumbs.db
ssh.txt
# Database dumps/backups must never be tracked (see docs/PJAX_LIVEWIRE_IMPROVEMENT_PLAN.md I1)
/storage/backups
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.dump

# Local agent/tool state
/.claude
